    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Background]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations on starting your CEO career!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re here to teach you how to manage the relationship between you and your secretary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you happen to experience anything else, well... that\u2019s just your imagination running wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/9559dc94634c79914c647fc6eddff87b.avif?t=1739444491\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  <br>[Game Feature]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>VR Secretary</i>, you will become a rookie CEO, managing not just the office, but also the subtle dynamics with your new secretary, Ailey. Here\u2019s what awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Roleplay:</strong> Take charge as a fresh CEO navigating a fully interactive VR office. From delegating tasks to sharing quiet moments after work, every scene brings you closer to the fine line between professionalism and personal connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scenarios:</strong> From managing tasks in the office to sharing drinks after hours\u2014every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Interaction: </strong>Explore a variety of poses and enjoy the freedom to interact closely with your secretary, creating a highly immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Tips]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before\u00a0you begin the first day as a CEO, here are some <strong>practical tips</strong> to keep in mind:<br><strong>Tip 1</strong>: Be polite and keep a professional distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=698 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip 2</strong>:\u00a0Maintain proper social etiquette, even when drinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip 3</strong>: Once everything is organized,\u00a0your career will reach the next level!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/AileyVR_Gif3.4.gif?t=1739444491\" width=646 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Prove you can stay cool, make the right calls, and survive the ultimate workplace challenge - if you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing VR Secretary. We hope you enjoy every moment of your office journey!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Background]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations on starting your CEO career!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re here to teach you how to manage the relationship between you and your secretary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you happen to experience anything else, well... that\u2019s just your imagination running wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/9559dc94634c79914c647fc6eddff87b.avif?t=1739444491\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  <br>[Game Feature]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/3560ce95880641f6680696166d6a1dff.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>VR Secretary</i>, you will become a rookie CEO, managing not just the office, but also the subtle dynamics with your new secretary, Ailey. Here\u2019s what awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Roleplay:</strong> Take charge as a fresh CEO navigating a fully interactive VR office. From delegating tasks to sharing quiet moments after work, every scene brings you closer to the fine line between professionalism and personal connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scenarios:</strong> From managing tasks in the office to sharing drinks after hours\u2014every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Interaction: </strong>Explore a variety of poses and enjoy the freedom to interact closely with your secretary, creating a highly immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Tips]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before\u00a0you begin the first day as a CEO, here are some <strong>practical tips</strong> to keep in mind:<br><strong>Tip 1</strong>: Be polite and keep a professional distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=698 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip 2</strong>:\u00a0Maintain proper social etiquette, even when drinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.poster.avif?t=1739444491\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.webm?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/90e15abdb34132ab2fa283c705ad3687.mp4?t=1739444491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip 3</strong>: Once everything is organized,\u00a0your career will reach the next level!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/AileyVR_Gif3.4.gif?t=1739444491\" width=646 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Prove you can stay cool, make the right calls, and survive the ultimate workplace challenge - if you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing VR Secretary. We hope you enjoy every moment of your office journey!</p>",
